{
 "what": "v9 (16 Nov 2026 03:5x UTC, Aras 03:43 'section lines are in the screenshot' / 'use them'): the section lines are the v7 lines drawn on slide 6 (unchanged); each node's place (pin) = where its A and B lines cross (nodes[*].pin), the node frame (zoom) centred on it, same size and turn. v8 (lines moved to the old pins) undone: nodes_v8 / lines_v8. v8 (16 Nov 2026 03:4x UTC, Aras 03:34 'move the nodes and their section lines and their respective zooms to the places that they are on map'): every node frame centred on its slide-6 pin (Slide06 log 'node pins mid working area'), A through the pin square to the stream (centreline tangent within 40 m), B along the stream on the pin's side, 30 m off (N2 50 m, bank top) or further until it neither crosses nor comes within 20 m of the centreline; frame edge to frame edge. nodes_v7 / lines_v7 = before. v7 (16 Nov 2026 01:4x UTC): N2-B moved 20 m onto the bank top (see changes). v6 (15 Nov 2026 22:2x UTC, Aras 22:10 'move the node 6 to the building that is across the river' + 22:15 screenshot 'n6 will be here' = his faceted-roof 'desings' building, u 1943-2099, v 301-381): N6 = strip u 1861-2181 (same 320 x 465 m) centred on that building; N6-A square to the stream through its middle, N6-B along its bank 30 m off the centreline, frame end to frame end. nodes_v5/lines_v5 = before. v5 (15 Nov 2026 15:2x UTC): N3 west end to u 705 so it reaches into the working area. v4 (15 Nov 2026, Aras 08:46 UTC 'yes' to moving N5 and N6 so the master.svg buildings sit inside them): N5 = strip u 1400-1795, N6 = u 1795-2115 (same v as v3); N5-A / N6-A cross the stream square to it through the building frames' middles (u 1699 / 2022), N5-B / N6-B run along the bank 12 / 30 m off the centreline at the frame ends (never crossing it), all edge to edge. nodes_v3/lines_v3 = before. v3 (15 Nov 2026, Aras approved the defaults 04:58 UTC: node frames apart and inside his masterplan drawing): every frame kept inside the masterplan drawing's frame (site_alan strip, 2,845 x 529 m, from the MasterplanBase cache matrix + svg_box); N1 cut to the strip's width; N5 and N6 slid across the strip (same size) to its far edge; N3 slid 51 m upstream and N4 starts where N3 ends and stops where N5 starts (no overlap); each A/B line re-run from frame edge to frame edge on the same line. nodes_v2/lines_v2 = before. Panel Review II section lines N1-A ... N6-B and node frames N1-N6 in survey coordinates (m). v2 (Aras 14 Nov 16:12-16:13 UTC: 'two section lines dont look at the same way ... if they are cross sections it is even better ... Section should cross all of the zone area at least'; 'shift this one aswell it is out of our working area'): A = square to the stream at the old A's stream point, from node frame edge to frame edge, looking downstream; B = parallel to the local stream direction (crossing A at right angles), 25-45 m off the stream on the frame-centre side where it stays out of the water inside the frame, frame edge to frame edge, looking at the stream. Both stay inside their node frame. lines_v1 = the 11 Nov lines (all looked the same way, some ran past the frame).",
