 "changes": [
  "15 Nov 2026 (Aras 04:58 UTC, 'All defaults are fine'): N4-A moved 22.6 m sideways (same direction) so it passes through the Kizil Avlu heritage point (30203.92, 31974.82, Data/bergama_access_heritage.json); was [30320.93, 32028.85] - [30064.07, 31849.71]",
  "15 Nov 2026 05:0x UTC: N4-A (moved onto the Kizil Avlu point) clipped edge to edge to the v3 N4 frame (shift ~1.6 m along itself)",
  "15 Nov 2026 05:3x UTC (run 12 FLAG: N4-B crossed the stream 77 deg off square): N4-B starts at u 1098 along the strip again (its v2 end), so it runs along the bank and no longer crosses the stream",
  "15 Nov 2026 08:5x UTC (Aras 08:46 'yes'): N5 u 1132-1531 -> 1400-1795, N6 u 2026-2343 -> 1795-2115 (master.svg bina_cerceve buildings at u 1605-1793 and 1939-2105, measured by the building-ideas thread +/-10 m); N5-A, N5-B, N6-A, N6-B redrawn; strip = basemap Frame of site_alan (FRAME_COPY), u from the west",
  "15 Nov 2026 15:2x UTC (Aras 15:14 'all the nodes are indeed in our working area', 15:14 'if your notes clashes update it to be carried to the inside of the area'): N3 Bazaar u 758-937 -> 705-937 (west end as library/node_ideas_2026-11-15/NODE_IDEAS.md, u 705); the v4 N3 frame lay wholly in the gap of the working area (Basemap calisma, u 735-981 along the strip, the covered stretch); now it overlaps the west working-area ring by 30 m at the upstream tunnel mouth. Lines unchanged (N3-A, N3-B stay inside). nodes_v4 = before",
  "15 Nov 2026 22:2x UTC (Aras 22:10 + 22:15 screenshot): N6 u 1795-2115 -> 1861-2181, centred on his faceted-roof 'desings' building (u 1943-2099, v 301-381); N6-A, N6-B redrawn",
  "16 Nov 2026 01:4x UTC (Aras 01:40 'take the n2b section somewhere else'): N2-B moved 20 m away from the stream onto the bank top (same direction, same look), re-clipped to the N2 frame and 0.8 m shorter at each end (so Sections leaves out the old line's Archicad background, length differs > 1 m). The old line ran 0-30 m beside the stream at s 103-146 m and dropped into a 61-65 m survey dip (DXF NOKTA_TAKEOMETRI) 4-6 m below the beds up- and downstream (unverified). On the new line a TIN of the course DXF heights reads 87 to 71 m with no dip. lines_v6 = before.",
  "16 Nov 2026 03:4x UTC: v8 node move to the pins: N1: frame and lines moved 42 m to the pin; A 530 m through the pin square to the stream; B 406 m long, 70 m off the stream on the pin's side; N2: frame and lines moved 152 m to the pin; A 393 m through the pin square to the stream; B 245 m long, 50 m off the stream on the pin's side; N3: frame and lines moved 21 m to the pin; A 262 m through the pin square to the stream; B 236 m long, 30 m off the stream on the pin's side; N4: frame and lines moved 93 m to the pin; A 314 m through the pin square to the stream; B 196 m long, 30 m off the stream on the pin's side; N5: frame and lines moved 14 m to the pin; A 388 m through the pin square to the stream; B 400 m long, 95 m off the stream on the pin's side; N6: frame and lines moved 157 m to the pin; A 492 m through the pin square to the stream; B 339 m long, 50 m off the stream on the pin's side",
  "16 Nov 2026 03:5x UTC: v9: lines back to v7; pins at the A x B crossings; frames centred on them: N1 pin 29759,32553 (A at 0.45, B at 0.52 of their lengths), frame moved 28 m; N2 pin 29862,32322 (A at 0.33, B at 0.84 of their lengths), frame moved 94 m; N3 pin 30106,32046 (A at 0.41, B at 0.54 of their lengths), frame moved 29 m; N4 pin 30167,31949 (A at 0.54, B at 0.90 of their lengths), frame moved 82 m; N5 pin 30598,31346 (A at 0.59, B at 0.74 of their lengths), frame moved 101 m; N6 pin 30906,31128 (A at 0.46, B at 0.62 of their lengths), frame moved 42 m"
